141
00:13:36,774 --> 00:13:39,276
Ene, izugarria da.

142
00:13:39,860 --> 00:13:40,820
Bai horixe.

143
00:13:40,903 --> 00:13:44,198
Besteak bezala garbitu ordez,
hona ekarri dute.

144
00:13:44,782 --> 00:13:46,450
Oso susmagarria da.

145
00:13:46,534 --> 00:13:51,205
Dena den, gorriak hilarazi dituzunez,

146
00:13:51,872 --> 00:13:56,210
diru-kopurua handitu da
eta erraz irabazi dugu bozketa.

147
00:13:56,836 --> 00:14:00,339
Eman diezaiogun txalo bero bat.

148
00:14:01,966 --> 00:14:03,592
Eskerrik asko!

149
00:14:04,176 --> 00:14:06,345
Azken finean, gutako bat zinen.

150
00:14:09,890 --> 00:14:11,725
Inozo alaena.

151
00:14:11,809 --> 00:14:13,519
Zer esan nizun?

152
00:14:13,602 --> 00:14:16,146
Ez zaude hemen borondatez.

153
00:14:16,939 --> 00:14:20,317
Zure gaineko arima mendekatzaileek
ekarri zaituzte.

154
00:14:29,827 --> 00:14:31,120
Entzuten dituzu?

155
00:14:31,203 --> 00:14:35,040
Zure lagunek belarrira oihukatzen dizute.

156
00:14:37,084 --> 00:14:41,255
Nahi bezainbeste estal ditzakezu,
baina alferrik da.

157
00:14:42,214 --> 00:14:44,466
Oihuak gero eta ozenagoak izango dira.

158
00:14:45,134 --> 00:14:49,889
Hil arte entzungo diezu oihuka.

159
00:15:00,983 --> 00:15:02,943
- Askatu ezazu!
- Askatu!

160
00:15:10,075 --> 00:15:11,619
Andrea, ondo zaude?

161
00:15:40,606 --> 00:15:41,649
Zer deritzozu?

162
00:15:41,732 --> 00:15:43,859
Zati onak atera diezazkiokegu.

163
00:15:49,406 --> 00:15:50,532
Astiro.

164
00:15:51,617 --> 00:15:53,535
Bat, bi, hiru!

165
00:15:58,374 --> 00:16:00,834
Lasai. Ez kezkatu.

166
00:16:02,503 --> 00:16:04,088
Orain 011 gutako bat da.

167
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:07,925
Ona ekarri dizugu, ezta?

168
00:16:09,468 --> 00:16:12,012
Egin digun oparia da.

169
00:16:12,096 --> 00:16:14,431
Zergatik ekarri duzu?

170
00:16:16,934 --> 00:16:19,395
Orain alde berean gaude.

171
00:16:19,478 --> 00:16:21,355
Ez da atsegina elkar ezagutzea?

172
00:16:23,148 --> 00:16:25,609
Aurrekoek arazo larriak izan zituzten

173
00:16:25,693 --> 00:16:30,155
sekretuak gordetzen zituztelako
elkarrekin ez fidatzeagatik.

174
00:16:30,239 --> 00:16:33,367
Baina gu elkarrekin fidatzen gara,
beraz, ez da sekreturik egongo.

175
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:36,453
Horregatik adostu dugu
hemen maskarak kentzea.

176
00:16:38,998 --> 00:16:40,040
Ezta?

177
00:16:56,473 --> 00:16:57,683
Beraz, zeu zara 011?

178
00:16:58,684 --> 00:17:01,478
Badakizu zer nolako dirutza
galdu dugun zure erruz?

179
00:17:02,354 --> 00:17:05,691
Ez daukagu denborarik.
Bizkor ibili behar dugu. Ekin.

180
00:17:08,736 --> 00:17:09,737
Zatoz hona.

181
00:17:11,155 --> 00:17:13,115
Erakutsiko dizut nola egiten den.

182
00:17:17,327 --> 00:17:18,829
Horixe da zure oparia.

183
00:17:19,872 --> 00:17:21,457
Oraindik bizirik dago?

184
00:17:21,540 --> 00:17:22,875
Bai, konortegabe.

185
00:17:24,710 --> 00:17:29,715
Bale. Ireki dezagun 011ren oparia, bale?

186
00:17:35,387 --> 00:17:36,722
- Zer da?
- Geldi.

187
00:17:36,805 --> 00:17:38,057
Zer…?

188
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:39,224
Jaitsi labana.

189
00:17:39,308 --> 00:17:40,893
- Bale.
- E, ze arraio?

190
00:17:40,976 --> 00:17:42,394
Egin atzera.

191
00:17:42,478 --> 00:17:44,146
Ez omen zara gutako bat?

192
00:17:44,229 --> 00:17:45,230
Puta ero alaena!

193
00:18:09,546 --> 00:18:11,715
Zergatik etorri nintzen jakin nahi?

194
00:18:14,343 --> 00:18:16,512
Nire komandantea zu bezalakoa zen,

195
00:18:18,514 --> 00:18:19,765
eta buruan tiro egin nion.

196
00:18:34,905 --> 00:18:38,283
Ez nazazu hil. Ez nago haiekin.

197
00:18:39,660 --> 00:18:41,578
Ni diruagatik baino ez nator.

198
00:18:42,162 --> 00:18:44,498
Salbatu ezazu.

199
00:18:46,583 --> 00:18:48,127
Hiltzen bada, zu ere bai.

200
00:19:41,889 --> 00:19:42,890
Jun-hee.

201
00:19:47,519 --> 00:19:49,021
Batatak gogoko dituzu.

202
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:23,096
Jauna.

203
00:20:24,973 --> 00:20:27,851
Jan beharko zenuke, pixka bat gutxienez.

204
00:20:35,525 --> 00:20:36,526
Ulertzen dut.

205
00:20:37,986 --> 00:20:42,282
Badakit salbatu nahi gintuzula.

206
00:20:42,908 --> 00:20:46,870
Gaiztoak zigortu
eta hau amaitu nahi zenuen.

207
00:20:49,289 --> 00:20:50,290
Sentitzen dut.

208
00:20:54,336 --> 00:20:55,671
Kargagailuak ekartzeko modua

209
00:20:57,422 --> 00:20:59,341
aurkitu beharko nukeen.

210
00:21:01,802 --> 00:21:03,887
Ez duzu barkamena eskatu behar.

211
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:06,348
Dae-horen errua da.

212
00:21:07,391 --> 00:21:11,520
Neuk ikusi nuen,
eta amak eta beste guztiek ere bai.

213
00:21:12,312 --> 00:21:15,774
Kargagailuen bila etorri zen,
baina, joatear zegoenean,

214
00:21:17,150 --> 00:21:19,278
lurrean botata geratu zen.

215
00:21:19,361 --> 00:21:24,574
Hyun-ju kargagailuen bila etorri zenean,
maskaradunak indarrez sartu ziren.

216
00:21:24,658 --> 00:21:26,827
Amak gelditu izan ez balu,

217
00:21:28,412 --> 00:21:30,122
bera ere hilko zuketen.

218
00:21:30,205 --> 00:21:31,665
Ezta, Hyun-ju?

219
00:21:32,624 --> 00:21:35,711
Honek ez du inor bueltaraziko.

220
00:21:36,503 --> 00:21:39,506
Bizirik gaudenok
aurrera egin behar dugu, ezta?

221
00:21:42,342 --> 00:21:45,053
Jan ezazu, mesedez.

222
00:21:45,137 --> 00:21:48,056
Edan ura ere bai
kontrako eztarritik ez sartzeko.

223
00:21:52,519 --> 00:21:55,314
Ene, adia guztiz galdurik dago.

224
00:22:18,378 --> 00:22:21,089
MOTELA

225
00:22:21,173 --> 00:22:23,175
AZAROAK 4, BILAKETAREN 4. EGUNA

226
00:22:32,934 --> 00:22:34,353
Hwang, lotan zaude?

227
00:22:35,312 --> 00:22:36,396
Ez, oraindik ez.

228
00:22:39,566 --> 00:22:42,069
Ba, esna zaudenez,

229
00:22:42,903 --> 00:22:45,322
tragotxo bat hartzen hitz egin dezakegu?

230
00:22:46,698 --> 00:22:47,991
Noski, sartu.

231
00:22:52,287 --> 00:22:53,497
Ez, milesker.

232
00:22:54,539 --> 00:22:56,875
A, bale.

233
00:23:03,632 --> 00:23:05,717
Zertaz hitz egin nahi zenuen?

234
